BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:WORLD GONE CRAZY: New England's Premiere Comedy Band!
DTSTART:20250201T000000
DTEND:20250201T020000
DTSTAMP:20260926T151138Z
UID:0db7653964aaffda2f48bfe7aad8af@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the "new & different" show you have been looking fo
 r! Imagine a band of funny musicians.... or a few comics who also play ins
 truments and perform live song parodies\, impressions\, fake commercials a
 nd audience interactive routines! World Gone Crazy rocks today's news for 
 laughs: This side splitting show skewers today's current events and issues
  by marrying with rapid fire songs and stand up comedy. Still trying to ge
 t your head around World Gone Crazy? Start the blender: Add 1 part BLUES B
 ROTHERS\, 2 parts BARENAKED LADIES with a little ADAM SANDLER as well to c
 omplete a hysterical recipe! Featuring Singer/Guitarist/Impressionist BRYS
 ON LANG ("Extreme Gong Show" \, "Austin Powers II" \, "Batman & Robin" ) D
 rummer and comic personality GARY MARINO (ABC's "Live with Kelly Ripa" \, 
 "Million Calorie March: The Movie!") and the talented Mr. Johnny Mac on BA
 SS Guitar & backing vocals. World Gone Crazy is a personality driven show 
 unlike any comedy night you've ever seen! World Gone Crazy's "Misheard Lyr
 ics Contest" is a show highlight and lets the audience win CDs\, T-Shirts 
 and get in on the real fun on stage. Launched 9 years ago for lovers of st
 and-up comedy and live music - there is simply no other live show like Wor
 ld Gone Crazy. Period!\n\nSources: Discover Central Massachusetts\nEvent p
 age: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/world-gone-crazy%3a-new-engla
 nds-premiere-comedy-band!/25390/
LOCATION:Samuel Slater's Restaurant\, 200 Gore Road\, Webster\, MA\, 01570
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/world-gone-crazy%3a-new-englan
 ds-premiere-comedy-band!/25390/
END:VEVENT
