BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MVP Open x OTB @ Maple Hill Disc Golf
DTSTART:20250927T000000
DTEND:20250927T020000
DTSTAMP:20260926T151138Z
UID:9d94116f5bfc602a87269884a37e66@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Maple Hill is proud to host the 8th annual MVP Open in 2025\, 
 marking its 22nd consecutive year as the premier event at this iconic venu
 e. For the 4th year\, it will also be a DGPT Playoff Event\, with Disc Gol
 f Pro Tour founder Steve Dodge and the Maple Hill team delivering an unfor
 gettable experience. Fans can look forward to exciting activities\, includ
 ing playing the elite-level course\, glow-in-the-dark rounds\, a $20k ace 
 run giveaway\, and more. The event will conclude with an awards ceremony h
 onoring the top MPO and FPO players in the DGPT World Standings. As the fi
 nal Playoff Event before the DGPT Championship\, the 2025 MVP Open promise
