UID:82bacd5cdd27c58bef35af57e63d2e@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Experience the captivating work of local artist Suzan Osborn w
 ith this captivating new collection of oil paintings inspired by her time 
 spent at New England Botanic Garden. Osborn’s luminous floral landscapes
  celebrate the color\, movement\, and quiet beauty of New England Botanic 
 Garden\, revealing fresh perspectives on cherished spaces and seasonal blo
 oms. Rendered in Osborn’s warm\, expressive style\, each work invites vi
 sitors to step into scenes shaped by nature and brought vividly to life on
  canvas. This exhibit is included with general garden admission. Learn mor
 e at: https://nebg.org/suzan-osborn-exhibit/\n\nSources: Discover Central 
 Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/timeles
 s%3a-floral-landscapes-by-suzan-osborn-at-new-england-botanic-garden/30514
