UID:9a2179d24dc3e1d2418f05d74c799a@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Discover a miniature world where magic blooms around every cor
 ner. The fairies return to New England Botanic Garden in a one-of-a-kind e
 xhibit featuring more than 20 intricately designed fairy houses expertly c
 rafted by artists from New England and beyond. From cozy mushroom cottages
  to enchanting seashell palaces\, this collection of creative abodes will 
 delight visitors of all ages. Magic awaits in Fairy Hollow. All you need i
 s your imagination—and a little bit of fairy dust. Experience Fairy Holl
 ow daily from August 29 to October 25\, or enjoy featured events like Fair
 ies Aglow\, the Weekend of Wonder\, or Faerie Masquerade Ball. Magically-t
 hemed programs for youth and adults enhance the experience. Learn more at 
 https://nebg.org/fairy-hollow/.\n\nSources: Discover Central Massachusetts
 \nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/fairy-hollow-at-new-
 england-botanic-garden/30632/
