DESCRIPTION:SPROUTS A Monthly Kids Club rooted in good food\, creativity\,
  play\, and community. American Flatbread's Kids Club takes place on the l
 ast Saturday of every month. See below for our monthly themes and general 
 information about the program September 26: Back-to-School Bash October 31
 : Spooktacular Bowling Party November 28: Turkey Trot Bowling December 26:
  Holiday Workshop ABOUT THE PROGRAM: Sprouts is a monthly Kids Club where 
 kids can create\, play\, and grow together. Each month features a new them
 ed experience with a hands on craft\, a special bowling activity\, and som
 ething fun to take home. From decorating pumpkins and holiday ornaments to
  scavenger hunts and summer celebrations\, there is always something new f
 or kids to look forward to. Every Sprouts event takes place on the last Sa
 turday of the month\, with dedicated time for kids to create and bowl afte
 r if they would like. 10:00–11:00 AM: Craft & Activity 11:00 AM: Venue O
 pens for regularly scheduled business and Bowling is available for reserva
 tion. Food and beverage purchases can be made at this time. Reservations f
 or bowling are encouraged. Kids receive a Sprouts membership card when the
 y join and earn a stamp for every monthly event they attend. Birthday Mont
 h Get a Sprouts Kids Club T-shirt + 50% off bowling for any birthday party
 . Must be used during the child’s birthday month. Grow With Us Attend 6 
 Events: Earn a free 1 hour of bowling Attend 12 Events: Celebrate your Bir
 thday with a free birthday party for up to 25 guests. This includes the re
 servation of 3 bowling lanes\, cheese pizza\, and pepperoni pizza. Must be
  used during the child’s birthday month\n\nSources: Discover Central Mas
 sachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/sprouts-ki
 ds-club-%7c-american-flatbread-worcester/30834/
LOCATION:American Flatbread Worcester\, 85 Green St. Suite 100\, Worcester
 \, MA\, 01604
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/sprouts-kids-club-%7c-american
 -flatbread-worcester/30834/
