 es as they forced local defenders of royal government to walk a gauntlet o
 f common men intent on defending their liberty as they spread their revolu
 tionary ideas between the town's taverns and meetinghouse. The tour begins
  and ends at Salisbury Mansion\, 40 Highland Street. Wear comfortable shoe
 s. COST: $15 Non-Members\; FREE for MOW Members. Space is limited to 25 pe
 ople. Registration is required. All are welcome - All ages appropriate. Pl
 ease note: In the event of inclement weather\, this tour will be presented
  at Museum of Worcester - Fletcher Auditorium.\n\nSources: Discover Centra
 l Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/worce
 ster-revolutionary-walking-tour-saturday-september-26-%40-1pm/30747/
