DESCRIPTION:Each September\, the seaside hamlet of Newburyport comes alive
 \, uniting filmmakers and audiences to celebrate this truly original Ameri
 can form of narrative storytelling. The 22nd edition of the NBPT DOCU FEST
  (September 25 – 27\, 2026) will feature 35 films from local\, regional
 \, national\, and international filmmakers\, including 5 World Premieres. 
 This year’s Festival offering spans a wide range of subject matter\, fro
 m intimate\, introspective personal stories to the profound impact of glob
 al issues—all to be experienced over an immersive three day period.\n\nS
 ources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/22nd-
 annual-newburyport-documentary-film-festival/2026-09-27/
LOCATION:Firehouse Center for the Arts\, 1 Market Square\, Newburyport\, M
 A\, 01950
