UID:7b965786ec2b0a4a425cf4ff67dd55@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:David Sedaris\, America’s best-selling humorist and social s
 atirist\, returns following the publication of his most recent book of sho
 rt stories\, “Happy Go Lucky”\, and his first ever children’s book\,
  “Pretty Ugly”. In his customary sartorial and humorous manner\, David
