 hed stories and commentary. As always\, the reading will be accompanied by
  a pre and post-show book signing.\n\nSources: Discover Central Massachuse
 tts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/an-evening-with-d
 avid-sedaris/29984/
