BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Little Lies – A Tribute to Fleetwood Mac
DTSTART:20261204T200000
DTEND:20261204T220000
DTSTAMP:20260926T151138Z
UID:6ef3777fc94289da66bc891e766ad9@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Little Lies is a high-energy\, authentic tribute band dedicate
 d to bringing the timeless music of Fleetwood Mac to life. With a passion 
 for preserving the iconic sound of one of rock’s most beloved bands\, Li
 ttle Lies takes audiences on a journey through the legendary catalog displ
 aying Fleetwood Mac in their prime with a fresh take on their classic vibe
 . The band also faithfully recreates their greatest hits with precision\, 
 power\, and heart.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northo
 fboston.org/event/little-lies-a-tribute-to-fleetwood-mac-2/
LOCATION:The Cut\, 177 Main Street\, Gloucester\, MA\, 01930
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/little-lies-a-tribute-to-fleetwood-mac
 -2/
END:VEVENT
