BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:La Fanciulla del West
DTSTART:20270123T130000
DTEND:20270123T150000
DTSTAMP:20260926T151138Z
UID:6fe74fea79e13885029932ac0a1d71@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Puccini’s exhilarating drama of the Wild West returns in a n
 ew staging by Richard Jones\, marking the company’s first new production
  of La Fanciulla del West in more than 30 years. Soprano Vida Miknevičiū
 tė will make her company debut singing the role of Minnie in Puccini’s 
 La Fanciulla del West\,replacing Sondra Radvanovsky who has withdrawn due 
 to personal reasons. Tenor SeokJong Baek is the dashing bandit who rambles
  into the remote California mining town to steal her heart\, opposite bari
 tone Christopher Maltman as the lawman determined to deliver justice—and
  win Minnie for himself. Maestro Keri-Lynn Wilson takes the podium to cond
 uct one of opera’s most action-packed adventures\, live from the Met sta
 ge to cinemas worldwide.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://
 northofboston.org/event/la-fanciulla-del-west/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
